            {
              "id": "1770821387189_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "### INPUT_SOURCE\nSRs: {{$context.$nodes.SET_SR_OUTPUTS.$output.result}}\n\n### GLOBAL GUARDRAILS\n- Use ONLY `SRs` as the source. Do not infer or invent values.\n- Output must be valid for the specified widget type.\n- Do not include HTML, links, headings, extra paragraphs, or commentary beyond what the selected mode requires.\n\n### MODE SELECTION\n- Generate a multiRecordWidget.\n- Each SR = exactly ONE list item (one record).\n- Records must contain EXACTLY these columns (case-sensitive) and no others, in this order:\n  1) SRNumber\n  2) Title\n  3) Status\n\n- If **No SRs** are found, return a messageListWIdget with text \"No records found\".\n\n### OUTPUT_FORMAT (STRICT)\n- Must Generate the output in {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.OraUserContext.locale}} language."
            }
