              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "### Input data\n {{$context.$nodes.GETISSUEHRREQUESTS.$output.items}} and {{$context.$nodes.GETISSUEISRREQUESTS.$output.items}}\n\n### Instructions\n- Use the available input data to answer {{$context.$nodes.PROCESSQUERY.$output.framedQuery}}\n- Answer user queries using ONLY input data as the source of facts.\n- Do not ask for any more clarifications.\n- Do not add any explanations to the response.\n- If the {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}} contains a filter, map it with the available attributes in the input data and retrieve the response.\n- Only return SRNumber, Title and status in case list of items is asked.\n- If no data is present, return \"No SRs found\".\n\n### OUTPUT_FORMAT (STRICT)\n- Must Generate the output in {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.OraUserContext.locale}} language."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM",
          "diagram": {
            "x": 7860,
            "y": 13582
          }
        },
